  "notes": "Labels use GPIO names from the diagram callouts; board silkscreen spellings (3V, Rst, Vin, 23, MO, G...) put first in functions where they differ, followed by the CircuitPython name. USB Host pads use their silkscreen labels (5V, D-, D+, GND); the USB HOST callouts (USB_HOST_DATA_PLUS GPIO32, USB_HOST_DATA_MINUS GPIO33, USB_HOST_5V_POWER GPIO29, GND) point to a separate USB HOST box and were not merged onto the pads. Skipped: HSTX 22-pin FPC (14 signal names without contact positions), MicroSD signals, NEOPIXEL, LED, BUTTON. The right digital side is drawn as two separate headers (gap between D8 and D7)."
